                        <h2 style="margin-top: 10px;">THE LAVETO GOSPEL OS</h2>
                        <div style="font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #888; margin-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #222; padding-bottom: 20px;">
